     /// The verdict against the part, in the body's frame: the top
-    /// against the part's top as the column verdict always read it, and
-    /// - once the floor has faced a tool - the floor against the part's
+    /// against the part's top as the column verdict always read it, and,
+    /// once the floor has faced a tool, the floor against the part's
